[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0107","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-3131","title":"Fortinet FortiOS FortiView 跨站脚本攻击","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 5.4.0至5.4.4及5.6.0版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于FortiView模块下\"Applications\"页面的filter输入参数未对用户输入进行充分过滤和转义，导致具有低权限的认证攻击者可通过构造恶意请求注入任意JavaScript代码。当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时，注入的脚本会在浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或页面内容篡改。攻击者需要拥有有效的低权限账号并诱使用户访问特制链接，利用条件相对受限。CVSS评分5.4，危害等级中危。Fortinet已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2017-3131"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-12T02:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:17:34Z","remediation":"立即将 FortiOS 升级至 5.6.1 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 FortiGate 管理界面中限制可访问 FortiView 模块的管理员 IP 范围，并禁用非必要的管理接口暴露到公网，以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100009","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039020","https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-17-104","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42388/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-3131.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-3131.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/513833aeab98cbcaf56894a792fbc925f347d901/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-3131.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/3xxx/CVE-2017-3131.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2017/3xxx/CVE-2017-3131.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/fortinet/fortios/CVE-2017-3131.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-3131.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/SSVC/data/2017/CVE-2017-3131.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-3131","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-3131.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-3131.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0888","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0888.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6627","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE UDP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 15.1/15.2/15.4 及 IOS XE 3.14~3.18 版本的 UDP 处理代码存在资源管理漏洞。由于软件在创建 UDP 套接字后未正确关闭空闲套接字，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标设备发送目标端口为 0 的特制 UDP 数据包，导致输入接口队列持续积压 UDP 报文，形成接口队列楔入（interface queue wedge），最终造成拒绝服务（DoS）条件。该漏洞影响大量 Cisco 路由器和交换机设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。当输入队列收到 250 个报文后会自动恢复，但攻击者可持续发送数据包维持拒绝服务状态。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6627"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-07T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:40Z","remediation":"该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议立即升级至 Cisco 修复版本（通过 Cisco bug ID CSCup10024、CSCva95506、CSCvc96281、CSCve64219 查询对应 IOS/IOS XE 修复版本）。如无法立即升级，可在所有接口配置 hold-queue 值大于 250（如 hold-queue 350 in）以缓解队列阻塞；或配置扩展 ACL 拒绝目标端口为 0 的 UDP 报文（access-list 180 deny udp any any eq 0），并将 ACL 应用到所有设备接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100644","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039289","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170906-ios-udp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6627","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6627.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6627.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6627","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/16901ed3086419e92a3d59446e25736507cf6a0b/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6627.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6627.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/75b5e380a041f7d82baaaae75856fe8702a1ff30/2017/CVE-2017-6627.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6627.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-c93x-vxh6-pfqp/GHSA-c93x-vxh6-pfqp.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0888.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0037","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12794","title":"Django 调试页面跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Django 1.10.8之前版本及1.11.5之前版本的技术500调试页面模板中存在HTML自动转义被禁用的问题，当Django开启DEBUG=True模式时，攻击者可通过构造特制请求触发500错误页面，利用模板中未转义的输出注入恶意脚本，实现跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。该漏洞影响开启了调试模式的生产环境，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击，窃取用户会话信息或执行恶意操作。建议用户关闭生产环境的DEBUG模式或升级至安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12794"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-07T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:56Z","remediation":"升级 Django 至 1.10.8 或 1.11.5 及以上版本。生产环境务必关闭 DEBUG=False，禁止在线上开启调试模式。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面拦截对 /technical_500/ 路径的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100643","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039264","https://usn.ubuntu.com/3559-1/","https://www.djangoproject.com/weblog/2017/sep/05/security-releases/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12794.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12794.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/django/CVE-2017-12794/README.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12794.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-12794-2921.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2017-12794.js","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12794","https://github.com/yhy0/CHYing-agent/blob/0d2ee81fa783caf119cde1423e390552e32561c0/knowledge/raw/framework/Django%20debug%20page%20XSS%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2017-12794.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-12794-2921.yaml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fb6b5b3f877cb85d43b44481d8426d9d97694f8/vex/cve/2017/CVE-2017-12794.json","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12794.poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0037.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0038","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14135","title":"opendreambox webadmin 插件操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"opendreambox 2.0.0 的 webadmin 插件中 Script.py 文件存在操作系统命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 /script 接口的 command 参数注入 shell 元字符，执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响运行 opendreambox 2.0.0 的设备，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者利用此漏洞可完全控制目标系统，实现数据窃取、恶意软件植入等操作。建议升级至最新版本或限制 /script 接口的访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14135"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-04T23:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:05:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 opendreambox 至 2.0.0 以上版本，或禁用 webadmin 插件（通过 Enigma2 插件管理界面移除或停用）。如无法升级，手动修复 Script.py：在 render 方法中对 command 参数进行输入验证，使用白名单机制仅允许执行 /usr/script 目录下的 .sh 脚本，并使用 subprocess 列表参数替代 shell=True 调用，彻底阻断 shell 元字符注入。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上限制对 webadmin 端口（如 80/8081/8880/10000）的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理网段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://the-infosec.com/2017/07/05/from-shodan-to-rce-opendreambox-2-0-0-code-execution/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14135.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14135.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14135.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-14135/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-14135.py","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2017-14135-2926.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6364e58b3f8fc3b67ee674788d4aa8c15d4b2e01/2017/CVE-2017-14135.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-14135_5.yaml","https://github.com/PetiteTaupe/automation-cve-testing/blob/8fbac77a20cb4af865eac2393918d158f1941817/data/raw/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14135.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/opendreambox/CVE-2017-14135.yaml","https://github.com/alessandrorepola/SRSS/blob/3278cf58a685dea58c27b58608b38af593dd8d2d/cve_data_retrival.ipynb","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Apr/16/Reports/rceReport.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0125","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-7855","title":"IceWarp Webmail 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"IceWarp Server 11.3.1.5 的 Webmail 组件中的 language 参数存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞（CWE-79），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的特制 URL，利用该参数将脚本注入到用户浏览器中执行。当用户点击攻击者发送的恶意链接并访问 IceWarp Webmail 页面时，注入的脚本将在用户会话上下文中运行，导致攻击者可窃取会话 Cookie、劫持用户账户或进一步实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响所有访问 IceWarp Webmail 界面的用户，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，且需要用户交互才能触发。IceWarp 作为企业级邮件与协作平台，被众多组织部署用于邮件服务和团队协作，因此该漏洞潜在影响面较广，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-7855"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-08-31T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:25:20Z","remediation":"立即升级 IceWarp Server 至最新稳定版本（当前为 14.x 系列），或在 Web 服务器前端部署 WAF 规则过滤 webmail 组件 language 参数中的尖括号与脚本标签。如无法立即升级，可临时在 Web 服务器层面对 /webmail/ 路径启用 XSS 过滤规则，拦截包含 <script>、onerror、javascript: 等关键词的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://technical.nttsecurity.com/post/102eegq/cookies-are-delicious","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-7855.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-7855.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-7855.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6c59753dc6e5de3c597a526685e2e9874d6f653a/cves/2017/7xxx/CVE-2017-7855.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/be9cbbdcace5bb1f0274d67feb2141e8b491875d/plugins/icewarp/server/CVE-2017-7855.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/67be6bea6496da8a804762a44a5511dd58ba8aa3/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-7855.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2017-7855.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-7855","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-7855.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-7855.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-7855.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0133","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0133.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9506","title":"Atlassian Jira OAuth 插件 SSRF 漏洞","description":"Atlassian Jira OAuth插件存在服务器端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。攻击者可利用IconUriServlet servlet在无需认证的情况下通过发送伪造的请求访问内部网络资源，甚至可能触发XSS攻击。该漏洞影响版本1.3.0-1.9.11（不含1.9.12）和2.0.0-2.0.3（不含2.0.4）的产品。攻击者可构造恶意请求利用SSRF漏洞探测内网服务、读取敏感文件（如AWS元数据）、甚至实现远程代码执行。该漏洞具有较高的安全风险，需立即关注并修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9506"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-08-23T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:28:15Z","remediation":"升级 Atlassian OAuth Plugin 到 1.9.12 或 2.0.4 及以上版本修复 SSRF 漏洞（参考 Atlassian 官方修复 OAUTH-344：https://ecosystem.atlassian.net/browse/OAUTH-344）。如无法立即升级，可禁用 OAuth 插件或在防火墙层面限制 Jira 服务器对内网地址（如 169.254.169.254、127.0.0.1、内网段）的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://dontpanic.42.nl/2017/12/there-is-proxy-in-your-atlassian.html","https://ecosystem.atlassian.net/browse/OAUTH-344","https://medium.com/bugbountywriteup/piercing-the-veil-server-side-request-forgery-to-niprnet-access-171018bca2c3","https://twitter.com/Zer0Security/status/983529439433777152","https://twitter.com/ankit_anubhav/status/973566620676382721","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9506.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-9506.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/b859fc75b332184195f1952ddeea761c6913ce9b/2017/CVE-2017-9506.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9506.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-9506.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-9506-3091.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-9506-3092.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-9506-3088.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-9506-3090.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-9506-3087.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/jira/CVE-2017-9506.md","https://github.com/random-robbie/Jira-Scan","https://github.com/labsbots/CVE-2017-9506","https://github.com/pwn1sher/jira-ssrf"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0209","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11357","title":"Progress Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"Progress Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 的 RadAsyncUpload 组件存在任意文件上传漏洞。该组件未对用户上传文件进行充分限制，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，绕过文件类型检查，上传包含恶意代码的 .NET 程序集文件至服务器，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 R2 2017 SP2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何权限和用户交互，利用复杂度低，已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，多个黑客组织曾利用此漏洞入侵目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11357"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-08-23T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:01:41Z","remediation":"立即升级到 R1 2020（2020.1.114）或更高版本，这是唯一能同时防御 CVE-2017-11357、CVE-2019-18935 等已知漏洞的版本。在 web.config 的 appSettings 中添加 `<add key=\"Telerik.Web.DisableAsyncUploadHandler\" value=\"true\" />` 禁用内置上传处理程序，并按照 RadAsyncUpload 安全文档配置加密密钥。如无法立即升级，可下载对应版本的官方安全补丁包替换 Telerik.Web.UI 程序集作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.telerik.com/support/kb/aspnet-ajax/upload-%28async%29/details/insecure-direct-object-reference","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43874/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-11357","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43874","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-11357.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11357.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-11357","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11357.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-11357/README.md","https://github.com/r1cksec/cheatsheets/blob/d5cc6d24474592639d45560098a2ad4d1aacf089/exploit/CVE-2017-11317.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2017/CVE-2017-11317.json","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/md/%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E9%BB%91%E5%AE%A2%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%85%A5%E4%BE%B5%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E8%81%94%E9%82%A6%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84.md","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2017/database/CVE-2017-11357/RAU_crypto-bao7uo.md","https://github.com/noperator/CVE-2019-18935/blob/7701b27f238b888bfa7168ea4fbe5a3b9550b110/RAU_crypto/RAU_crypto.py","https://github.com/bao7uo/RAU_crypto"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0208","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11317","title":"Progress Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 加密漏洞致任意文件上传与远程代码执行","description":"Progress Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 框架中的 RadAsyncUpload 组件使用了弱加密算法，攻击者可在无需身份认证的情况下远程解密加密参数，绕过文件类型限制上传任意文件（如 ASPX 木马），进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 R1 2017 之前版本及 R2 2017 SP2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。公开的 PoC 已广泛流传，攻击者仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可完成利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11317"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-08-23T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:01:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 至 R2 2017 SP2（版本 2017.2.711）或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 web.config 中禁用 RadAsyncUpload 上传功能，或限制仅允许认证用户访问 Telerik.Web.UI.WebResource.axd 处理程序，并在 IIS 中配置请求过滤规则阻止对 /Telerik.RadUploadHandler.ashx 的未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159653/Telerik-UI-ASP.NET-AJAX-RadAsyncUpload-Deserialization.html","http://www.telerik.com/support/kb/aspnet-ajax/upload-%28async%29/details/unrestricted-file-upload","https://psirt.global.sonicwall.com/vuln-detail/SNWLID-2018-0006","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43874/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-11317","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-11317.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2017/CVE-2017-11317.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/d076885aa708192e112f41f2fee6154ece5e7b86/data/2017/CVE-2017-11317-bao7uo_RAU_crypto.md","https://github.com/r1cksec/cheatsheets/blob/d5cc6d24474592639d45560098a2ad4d1aacf089/exploit/CVE-2017-11317.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-11317","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/fbb83465db9f8eb048237338aeda5d9d7fa146a4/2017/CVE-2017-11317/README.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-11317.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-11317.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11317.json","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/35085.txt","https://github.com/bao7uo/RAU_crypto","https://github.com/0xr2r/CVE-2017-11317-auto-exploit-","https://github.com/KasunPriyashan/Telerik-UI-ASP.NET-AJAX-Exploitation","https://github.com/KasunPriyashan/Unrestricted-File-Upload-by-Weak-Encryption-affected-versions-CVE-2017-11317-Remote-Code-Execut"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0208.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0208.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0026","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11610","title":"Supervisor inet_http_server XML-RPC 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Supervisord inet_http_server 存在 XML-RPC 服务器漏洞。攻击者可通过精心 crafted 的 XML-RPC 请求利用嵌套 supervisord 命名空间查找漏洞，在相关 Supervisor 版本（3.0.1 及更早版本、3.1.x 及更早版本、3.2.x 及更早版本、3.3.x 及更早版本）中执行任意命令，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，影响等级高。Microsoft 和 Supervisor 团队已在安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议升级到最新版本以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11610"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-08-23T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:04Z","remediation":"立即升级 Supervisor 到 3.0.1、3.1.4、3.2.4、3.3.3 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade supervisor）。若无法立即升级，请在 supervisord.conf 中注释掉 [inet_http_server] 段或将 port 绑定到 127.0.0.1 仅本地访问，并设置强密码认证，同时在防火墙层面限制 9001 端口仅允许受信任 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2017/dsa-3942","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3005","https://github.com/Supervisor/supervisor/blob/3.0.1/CHANGES.txt","https://github.com/Supervisor/supervisor/blob/3.1.4/CHANGES.txt","https://github.com/Supervisor/supervisor/blob/3.2.4/CHANGES.txt","https://github.com/Supervisor/supervisor/blob/3.3.3/CHANGES.txt","https://github.com/Supervisor/supervisor/issues/964","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/4GMSCGMM477N64Z3BM34RWYBGSLK466B/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/DTPDZV4ZRICDYAYZVUHSYZAYDLRMG2IM/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/JXGWOJNSWWK2TTWQJZJUP66FLFIWDMBQ/","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201709-06","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42779/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42779","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11610.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-11610.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/supervisor/CVE-2017-11610/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-11610.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2017-11610.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E4%BB%B6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/Supervisord%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2017-11610.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-11610/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-11610.py","https://github.com/jiangsir404/POC-S/blob/eb06d3f54b1698362ad0b62f1b26d22ecafa5624/pocs/script/supervisor/supervisord-RCE-CVE-2017-11610.py","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/middleware/Supervisord-%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-CVE-2017-11610.md","https://github.com/ybdt/exp-hub/blob/cae1cf153c434635991ac2662dbe8336ced026c7/Supervisord/Supervisord%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%EF%BC%88CVE-2017-11610%EF%BC%89/readme.md","https://github.com/ysrc/xunfeng/blob/40d40ecf55910019b8b904ef70ae1eebb6b6d26f/vulscan/vuldb/crack_supervisor_web.py","https://github.com/yaunsky/CVE-2017-11610","https://github.com/Dungsocool/CVE-2017-11610","https://github.com/ivanitlearning/CVE-2017-11610"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0026.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0026.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0808","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6327","title":"赛门铁克 Messaging Gateway 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"赛门铁克 Messaging Gateway（原 Brightmail）10.6.3-2 及之前版本存在未认证远程代码执行漏洞。漏洞由两个缺陷链式触发：一是 Web 认证绕过，LoginAction.notificationLogin 方法使用静态 PBEWithMD5AndDES 密钥加密参数，攻击者可伪造任意用户会话；二是 RestoreAction.performRestore 中 localBackupFilename 参数存在命令注入，经 sudo 包装脚本 db-restore 最终在 Perl 调用 /usr/bin/du 时执行任意命令。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，获取 root 权限完全控制设备。该漏洞影响部署为物理设备或 ESX 虚拟设备的邮件安全网关产品，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危，已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6327"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-08-11T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:09Z","remediation":"立即升级 Symantec Messaging Gateway 至 10.6.3-267 或更高版本（可通过 Broadcom 支持门户下载补丁）。若暂时无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙限制对管理控制台端口（默认 443/8443）的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问，并启用 WAF 防御命令注入攻击载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2017/Aug/28","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100135","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42519/","https://www.symantec.com/security_response/securityupdates/detail.jsp?fid=security_advisory&pvid=security_advisory&year=&suid=20170810_00","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6327","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42519","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6327.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/16901ed3086419e92a3d59446e25736507cf6a0b/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6327.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6327","https://github.com/DannyRavi/nmap-scripts/blob/4789967c540041077c3e74e5132812dd81f0b4d9/symantic-CVE-2017-6327.nse","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6327/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6327.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-6327.json","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/28326.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-6327.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0808.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0808.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0018","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-10075","title":"Oracle WebCenter Content未授权操作漏洞","description":"Oracle WebCenter Content 组件（Content Server 子组件）存在未授权操作漏洞（CNVD-2017-24345），影响 Oracle Fusion Middleware 版本 11.1.1.9.0、12.2.1.1.0 和 12.2.1.2.0。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 协议利用该漏洞攻击 WebCenter Content，攻击成功需要除攻击者以外的人员进行人为交互（如点击恶意链接）。漏洞利用成功可导致未经授权访问关键数据、完全访问所有可访问的 WebCenter Content 数据，以及对部分可访问数据进行未授权的更新、插入或删除操作，且可能显著影响关联产品。CVSS 3.0 基础评分 8.2（高危），向量为 CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:L/A:N，攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限、需用户交互、范围扩大、机密性高影响、完整性低影响、可用性无影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2017-10075"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-08-08T15:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:59:34Z","remediation":"建议立即安装Oracle Fusion Middleware 2024年8月安全更新（具体补丁编号可参考官方安全 advisories），或升级到Oracle WebCenter Content 12.2.1.3.0及以上版本。如无法立即应用补丁，可临时停用受影响的Content Server服务或通过防火墙限制对HTTP端口的访问，以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujul2017-3236622.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99807","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038940","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-10075.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-10075.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-10075.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-10075-2853.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-10075","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-10075_3.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2017-10075_1_2.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-10075_4.yaml","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/f09caa3ae3bd523ded47798246ed2d0175019dae/docs/data/2017/CVE-2017-10075.json","https://github.com/amad3us47/amad3us47.github.io/blob/038bbc4e769d48f20238029d708287b68d5d159f/data/cve-2017-10075-2851.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/afbf506b1b816f3e214d7dbd451d8627ce430c7a/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-100xx/CVE-2017-10075.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0509","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12637","title":"SAP NetWeaver Application Server Java 目录遍历漏洞","description":"SAP NetWeaver Application Server Java 7.5 的 scheduler/ui/js/ffffffffbca41eb4/UIUtilJavaScriptJS 组件存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向受影响路径发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意查询字符串，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞已在 2017 年 8 月被野外利用，影响范围广泛。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。SAP 已在安全公告 2486657 中提供修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12637"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-08-07T20:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:42Z","remediation":"立即应用 SAP Security Note 2486657 对应的补丁包。对于 SAP NetWeaver Application Server Java 7.5，需升级至包含该 Note 的 Support Package 或更高版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截包含 `../` 的请求路径，特别是针对 `/scheduler/ui/js/` 路径的目录遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://web.archive.org/web/20170807202056/http://www.sh0w.top/index.php/archives/7/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12637","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12637.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12637.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-12637.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12637.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-12637-2919.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/6c6d18949177131bcbf6851928af0eaf8e015f47/data/2017/CVE-2017-12637-abrewer251_CVE-2017-12637_SAP-NetWeaver-URL-Traversal.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2017-12637.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2017-12637-2917.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2017-12637.json","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2017-12637-2916.yaml","https://github.com/abh2technology/abh2-custom-templates-nucleiengine/blob/c7ba146f8016161974a9cf9f812ae7f225d23065/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12637.yaml","https://github.com/abrewer251/CVE-2017-12637_SAP-NetWeaver-URL-Traversal"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0029","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6663","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE Autonomic Networking 访问控制漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 软件的自主网络功能存在访问控制漏洞，未经身份认证的相邻攻击者可通过发送特制的自主网络协议数据包，触发受影响设备的自主节点重载，导致拒绝服务（DoS）攻击。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS Software 和 Cisco IOS XE Software 的 Denali-16.2.1 和 Denali-16.3.1 版本，CVSS 评分 6.5（中危），攻击向量为相邻网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限和用户交互，主要影响系统可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6663"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-08-07T06:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:45Z","remediation":"由于 Cisco 未发布修复该漏洞的软件更新且无官方临时缓解措施，建议采取以下措施：1) 若业务不需要 Autonomic Networking 功能，在全局配置模式下执行 `no autonomic` 命令禁用该功能并保存配置重启设备；2) 在二层网络部署 802.1X 和端口安全机制，限制未授权设备接入同一广播域；3) 通过接入控制列表 (ACL) 限制相邻网络设备对 ACP 通道的访问，仅允许受信任管理设备通信；4) 持续关注 Cisco PSIRT 公告以获取未来可能的补丁发布。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99973","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038999","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170726-anidos","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6663","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6663.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6663.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6663","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/16901ed3086419e92a3d59446e25736507cf6a0b/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6663.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6663.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6663.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3h3r-w377-6ffg/GHSA-3h3r-w377-6ffg.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2017-6663.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0032","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12583","title":"DokuWiki doku.php 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"DokuWiki 至 2017-02-19b 版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 doku.php 页面的 at 参数（即 DATE_AT 变量）中。攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 并诱导已登录用户点击，在用户浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，但需要用户交互，影响所有使用受影响版本的 DokuWiki 实例。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12583"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-08-06T03:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 DokuWiki 至包含 commit 6057f47 的版本（2017-02-19b 之后的任何版本），该提交在 doku.php 中对 $DATE_AT 变量输出添加了 htmlspecialchars() 转义，可有效防御反射型 XSS。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面添加 WAF 规则，拦截包含 <script> 等恶意标签的 at 参数请求，或修改 inc/html.php 中 msg() 函数的输出逻辑，对用户输入进行 HTML 实体编码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/splitbrain/dokuwiki/issues/2061","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12583.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12583.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12583.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12583.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2017-12583-2893.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2017-12583-2892.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2017-12583_1.yaml","https://github.com/Ciyfly/woodpecker/blob/f88bed6da55238547a423ce17dccb2cdbc93be50/pocs/nuclei/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12583.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12583.json","https://github.com/zcomtenten/cwaf/blob/f9a3f105768d72bb3ea1585fdc963176d1f41f73/categories.conf","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/3f3db248386948e3da5cade8b5f0c138fe802024/data/lists/NucleiList.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0028","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12138","title":"XOOPS XOOPS Core URL重定向漏洞","description":"XOOPS Core 2.5.8 的 /modules/profile/index.php 页面存在 URL 重定向绕过漏洞。由于对用户输入的 URL 过滤不严，攻击者可通过构造特制的重定向参数绕过过滤机制，将用户引导至恶意外部站点。攻击者利用该漏洞可实施钓鱼攻击，诱导用户访问仿冒页面从而窃取敏感信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要用户交互触发，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12138"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-08-02T05:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:45Z","remediation":"立即将 XOOPS Core 升级到 2.5.9 或更高版本，该版本已修复 /modules/profile/index.php 中 xoops_redirect 参数 URL 过滤绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 User Profile 模块，或在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）层面添加规则拦截包含异常 xoops_redirect 参数的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100091","https://github.com/XOOPS/XoopsCore25/issues/523","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12138.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12138.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12138.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12138.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045